<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak President returns bank law to parliament.</title>
<headline>Slovak President returns bank law to parliament.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovak President Michal Kovac on Wednesday returned a law barring bank privatisation to parliament, the president's office said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;President Michal Kovac on Wednesday acknowledged the government's request not to sign the law barring privatisation of banks and returned it to parliament for re-assessment,&quot; the presidential statement said.</p>
</text>
